The '''God Potion''' is a {{Special}} consumable item that gives the consumer a large assortment of positive potion effects and brews at max levels for a minimum of {{green|12 hours}}.

== Obtaining ==
=== NPC Vendors ===
'''God Potions''' can be bought for {{Bits|1.5k}} from the [[Bits Shop]], accessible at {{NPCSprite|Elizabeth}} in the [[Community Center]]. 

