==== Duration ====
The default duration of the God Potion effect is {{green|12 hours}}, this can be increased via the player's [[Alchemy]] skill levels up to {{green|24 hours}} using the following formula:
<math>12 + 0.24 \times (\text{Player's Alchemy Level})</math>
The total duration can also be increased via {{Item|Parrot Pet|rarity=Legendary}} by {{green|0.2%—20%}}. The maximum possible duration of the [[God Potion Effect]] from a single consumed God Potion is {{green|28 hours}} and {{green|48 minutes}}. Consuming '''God Potion''' while the effect is already active will sum up the durations up to {{Green|192 hours}} ({{Green|8 days}}). 

=== Mixins ===
{{main|Mixins}}

Mixins are used to upgrade God Potions to give them various buffs. There are currently {{green|13}}<!-- Newest included: Hotspot Tonic Mixin--> different [[Mixins]]. Some require reaching [[Slayer]] level 8 in their respective Slayer to be unlocked. They're obtained through various shops, such as {{NPCSprite|Bartender}}'s or {{NPCSprite|Agnes}}', or via crafting. Other Mixins are craftable and do not require Slayer requirements.

*The player cannot consume '''God Potions''' with [[Mixins]] for which they do not meet the [[Slayer]] requirement.
**They however can use the same mixin to apply is to a '''God Potion''' inside a brewing stand, even without the [[Slayer]] requirement.
*Multiple [[Mixins]] can be put on a God Potion, and they will all be listed in the order in which they were applied.

